  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A sustainability-linked loan (SLL) of up to EUR 25 million to Dominari Group, a  leading Lithuanian producer of polyurethane foam and upholstery. The loan  proceeds will be used in line with LMA Sustainability-Linked Loan Principles,  including the development of a sustainability framework. The Project qualifies  as 100% GET. EBRD financing supports the Group&apos;s expansion related to capital  expenditures (capex) such as the construction of a new workshop facility and  the expansion of working capital.  Null Value</narrative>
  </description>
